-- =============================================================================
-- LearnSync -- Initial Data Population Script
-- BAIT3173 / BMIT3173 Integrative Programming -- Group Assignment
--
-- Authors: Serena Lim Sze Kee   (Module 1 -- Identity, Access & Digital Credentialing)
--          Foo Chong Xian       (Module 2 -- Academic Resources Repository)
--          Ong Shun Yan         (Module 3 -- Student Forum & Notifications)
--          Wong Siew Lam        (Module 4 -- Skill Assessment & Quiz)
--          Ong Kwong Wei        (Module 5 -- Academic Progress Analytics)
--
-- Purpose: Populates every table with the working demonstration data set:
--          65 users, 35 permissions across 8 groups, 6 courses, 6 quizzes,
--          23 questions, 11 badges, 2 certificate templates, 76 issued
--          certificates, 279 grades and the supporting forum, calendar,
--          notification and progress records.
--
-- Usage:   Run 01_create_database.sql first, then:
--          mysql -u root -p edusystem < 02_seed_data.sql
--
-- Note:    Runtime tables (cache, sessions, jobs, password_reset_tokens) are
--          deliberately excluded. They are rebuilt by the application and hold
--          no initial data. Foreign key checks are disabled for the duration of
--          the load so that table order does not matter, then re-enabled.
--
--          All passwords are bcrypt hashes. The demonstration accounts use the
--          credentials listed in docs/README.md.
-- =============================================================================

